SUMMARY:[Greater Orlando Volleyball Club] Saturday Indoor Volleyball Leagu
 e - Fall '26
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T210000
UID:Greater_Orlando_Volleyball_Club-Saturday_Indoor_Volleyball_League_-_Fa
 ll_'26-2026-09-12T17:00:00
DESCRIPTION:League Format: 6v6 teams (coed optional) • Rosters: 7+\, no 
 cap (we recommend 8) • At least four sets each week • Sets played to 2
 1\, 21\, 15 (50-minute matches) • USAV rules with refs (teams provide of
 ficials)\n\nPrice: $70 early bird\, $75 regular\, $80 late • Payment pla
 ns available\n\nLeague Perks: League t-shirt (Week 2/3\, sponsorship depen
 dent) • Championship shirts + medals • End of season party\n\nSeason S
 chedule: September 12  - Week 1 • November 14- Championship Week • Se
 ptember: 12\, 19\, 26 • October: 3\, 10\, 17\, • November: 7\, 14\n\nD
 ivisions: One coed division • Men’s height net • Intermediate level 
 required\n\nFree Agents: We suggest that those interested in playing witho
 ut a team come to the Open Gym + Team Practice session. Our league general
 ly fills up quickly and we rarely have a full spot for free agent teams. 
 • We also have open gyms in August that would also be a great place to m
 ake friends and build teams. You can find those sessions here: https://go
 adultsportsleague.leagueapps.com/classes/5064743-open-gym---summer-series
 \n\nSubs: Outside subs: Must be invited + pay the single-day fee. No Execp
 tions • League players can sub freely (Penalties apply for missing Refer
 ee assignments) • No subs on Championship Week • See you on the court.
  Greater Orlando Volleyball\n\nSeason: Fall 2026\n\nMore info: https://goa
 dultsportsleague.leagueapps.com/leagues/volleyball-(indoor)/5094328-saturd
 ay-indoor-volleyball-league---fall-26
LOCATION:Dover Shores Community Center
